SUMMARY:Predicting Multimorbidity Trajectories: A Methodological Ladder f
 rom Cox to Transformers
DESCRIPTION:Compares single-outcome Cox models with complex longitudinal 
 models predicting several outcomes. Deep learning transformers show adva
 ntages for multimorbidity prediction.\nhttps://www.kcl.ac.uk/events/pred
 icting-multimorbidity-trajectories-a-methodological-ladder-from-cox-to-t
